# API Contract Rules

## 1. Communication
- All API calls go through /services layer in frontend
- Backend must always return JSON

## 2. Response format
Always follow:
{
  "success": boolean,
  "data": any,
  "message": string
}

## 3. Error format
{
  "success": false,
  "message": string,
  "error_code": string
}

## 4. Naming conventions
- Use snake_case in backend
- Use camelCase in frontend
- Convert at API boundary only

## 5. Versioning
- API endpoints must be versioned: /api/v1/...